# Azure Databricks

This folder contains the transformation framework for the MediCore data engineering project.

## Planned components

- Bronze layer ingestion and raw data preservation
- Silver layer data cleansing and standardization
- Data quality validation and error handling
- Gold layer dimensional modelling
- Fact and dimension tables for analytics
- Full and incremental processing
- Reusable parameterized notebooks
- Job execution monitoring and logging

## Security

- Do not commit credentials, access keys, or secrets.
- Do not commit real patient data.
- Use Azure managed identities and Key Vault where appropriate.
